---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/experiences.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Join Our Creator Community — SEEN IN KOREA"
  description="Introduce your Instagram, TikTok or YouTube creator profile for future Korean dining, beauty and cultural experiences."
>
  <main class="exp-page">
    <section class="exp-hero"><div class="wrap exp-hero-inner">
      <div class="exp-kicker">SEEN IN KOREA / CREATORS</div>
      <h1>Your Korea stories<br />start here.</h1>
      <p>Interested in sharing local experiences with your audience? Introduce your profile for future creator campaigns. Applications do not guarantee selection or a free experience.</p>
      <div class="exp-actions"><a class="exp-btn exp-btn-light" href="/experiences">Explore experiences</a></div>
    </div></section>

    <section><div class="wrap exp-form-layout">
      <div class="exp-form">
        <h2>Creator introduction</h2>
        <p>Register your public creator profile for future opportunities. Submissions are stored privately, but this does not create a login account or guarantee selection.</p>
        <form id="creator-intro-form" data-experience-endpoint="/api/experiences/creators">
          <div class="exp-hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div>
          <div class="exp-fields">
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-name">Name or creator handle *</label><input id="creator-name" name="name" type="text" maxlength="100" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-email">Contact email *</label><input id="creator-email" name="email" type="email" maxlength="150" autocomplete="email" required /></div>
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-social">Public Instagram, TikTok or YouTube profile URL *</label><input id="creator-social" name="social" type="url" maxlength="300" placeholder="https://www.instagram.com/..." required /></div>
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-followers">Approximate follower count *</label><select id="creator-followers" name="followers" required><option value="">Choose a range</option><option>Under 500</option><option>500–2,999</option><option>3,000–9,999</option><option>10,000–49,999</option><option>50,000+</option></select></div>
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-area">Where can you visit in Korea? *</label><input id="creator-area" name="area" type="text" maxlength="160" placeholder="Seoul, Gyeonggi-do, visiting dates..." required /></div>
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-languages">Main content language(s) *</label><input id="creator-languages" name="languages" type="text" maxlength="120" placeholder="English, Japanese..." required /></div>
            <div class="exp-field"><label for="creator-audience">Audience location / content topics (optional)</label><textarea id="creator-audience" name="audience" maxlength="600" placeholder="E.g. mostly US followers, Korea travel and food"></textarea></div>
          </div>
          <label class="exp-check"><input name="adult" type="checkbox" required /> <span>I confirm that I am at least 18 years old. *</span></label>
          <label class="exp-check"><input name="eligibility" type="checkbox" required /> <span>I understand that eligibility to participate in any complimentary-content campaign, including any applicable immigration or work-activity restrictions, must be confirmed before participation. *</span></label>
          <label class="exp-check"><input name="disclosure" type="checkbox" required /> <span>I understand that sponsored posts require clear disclosure and that Google Maps reviews are not campaign deliverables. *</span></label>
          <label class="exp-check"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" required /> <span>I consent to SEEN IN KOREA storing these details for creator screening and contacting me about opportunities. *</span></label>
          <button class="exp-btn exp-btn-accent" type="submit">Submit creator introduction</button>
          <p data-result role="status" aria-live="polite" class="exp-form-result"></p>
          <p class="exp-small">Your information is stored privately, not shown on the public site. For removal requests, email <a class="exp-link" href="mailto:seeninkorea@gmail.com">seeninkorea@gmail.com</a>. Read our <a class="exp-link" href="/experiences/privacy">data-use notice</a>. Do not submit passport numbers or identity documents.</p>
        </form>
      </div>
      <aside class="exp-aside"><h3>Before you apply</h3><p>This form registers your interest in future opportunities. To apply to a specific published campaign, visit the Experiences page.</p><ul><li>Real audiences and recent engagement matter more than a follower-count promise.</li><li>You are free to share an honest opinion; no positive review is required.</li><li>Free products or services are disclosed as sponsored benefits where applicable.</li><li>Any later experience has separate dates, eligibility checks and agreed deliverables.</li></ul><a class="exp-link" href="/experiences">Back to Experiences →</a></aside>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <script>
    import '../../scripts/experience-submit';
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
